OL,4,CTributes for Duran Duran guitarist     
OL,5,CAndy Taylor after his death aged 65    
OL,6,GSimon Le Bon, Sir Rod Stewart and Gary 
OL,7,GKemp are among the pop stars who have  
OL,8,Gpaid tribute to Duran Duran guitarist  
OL,9,GAndy Taylor following his death at the 
OL,10,Gage of 65.                             
OL,12,FTaylor co-wrote some of the group's    
OL,13,Fbiggest hits including Save A Prayer,  
OL,14,FRio and Girls On Film.                 
